game? Every time you complete a Box Pack, you'll earn its special <i><strong>Steam Achievement</strong></i>.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't forget to show your results to the community and spread the word with your friends, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >they may want to compete with you ;)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541380/extras/a83c9aa60b061fb72c5d508bea739bbd.avif?t=1751520331\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541380/extras/f221e128dbdeaebe6f4bbf6c8f11e2ae.avif?t=1751520331\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi there, <strong>Frank Eno</strong>'s here, I have been creating escape room and puzzle games since 2020 under the name of\u00a0 <strong>XSGames</strong>, doing all by myself: code, graphics, music, design, concept, etc. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>If you like my works, consider leaving a review here on Steam, your support will be greatly appreciated!</strong></i></p>",
